sequenceDiagram
    participant CI
    participant Daemon
    participant Agent A
    participant Agent B

    Agent A->>Daemon: Turn complete (blocked)
    CI->>Daemon: Build failed (via sync)
    Daemon->>Daemon: Budget check: OK
    Daemon->>Agent A: Auto-unblock with CI context
    Agent A->>Daemon: Fixed, turn complete
    Daemon->>Daemon: Detect state change
    Daemon->>Agent B: SSE: upstream.updated
    Agent B->>Agent B: Auto-sync with parent
